---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Jose Moreno - Now" description="What is Jose Moreno up to nowadays.">
    <div class="flex flex-col w-200 mx-auto">
        <div class="mt-6 mb-7">
            <h1 class="text-ink font-serif text-8xl">Now.</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-ink font-sans mt-4">
                Last Updated Nov. 21, 2026 - 
                <span class="header-li-hover">
                    <a href="https://nownownow.com/"> what is this?</a>
                </span>
            </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-ink font-sans text-xl font-light mt-6 mb-10 tracking-wide">
            Based in
            <span class="font-bold"> Los Angeles, CA. </span> 
            Open to work!
        </p>

        <article>
            <h1 class="text-ink text-4xl font-serif font-light">
                Work & Interests
            </h1>

            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-5 text-ink font-sans font-medium text-lg/8 font-light *:not-first:mt-5 tracking-wide">
                <li>
                    Exploring a computer vision-powered blackjack card-counting system using 
                    a camera, Raspberry Pi, and *maybe* a custom trained AI model.
                </li>
                
                <li>
                    Fascinated by the engineering behind modern defense systems, particularly
                    how weapons like the C-RAM uses radar, RTT, and automated targeting to intercept incoming threats.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Curious about algorithmic revenue management in PropTech, such as RealPage's AIRM and how it
                    uses occupancy, lease expirations, and market conditions to influence rental pricing.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Growing interest in collecting sports memorabilia, and the growing market for the rare collectibles.
                    I also like to convince myself that this year is the Yankee's year for #28...
                </li>
            </ul>

            <p class="text-muted-ink text-base font-sans tracking-wide mt-8 italic">
                *This page is updated when something significant changes. Inspired by
                <span class="header-li-hover underline">
                    <a href="https://nownownow.com/"> nownownow.com.</a>
                </span>
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>